N">敞开车篷，呼啸而过</span></p><p begin="00:29.269" end="00:32.069" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:29.469" end="00:29.881">Fast</span> <span begin="00:29.881" end="00:30.263">lane</span> <span begin="00:30.263" end="00:30.592">livin'</span> <span begin="00:30.592" end="00:30.789">'til</span> <span begin="00:30.789" end="00:30.979">they</span> <span begin="00:30.979" end="00:31.154">put</span> <span begin="00:31.154" end="00:31.345">me</span> <span begin="00:31.345" end="00:31.542">in</span> <span begin="00:31.542" end="00:31.647">the</span> <span begin="00:31.737" end="00:32.069">ground</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">极速人生，至死方休</span></p><p begin="00:32.069" end="00:34.133" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:32.069" end="00:32.245">And</span> <span begin="00:32.245" end="00:32.420">I</span> <span begin="00:32.420" end="00:32.794">don't</span> <span begin="00:32.794" end="00:33.073">wanna</span> <span begin="00:33.073" end="00:33.427">stop</span> <span begin="00:33.553" end="00:34.133">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而此刻，我绝不停留</span></p><p begin="00:34.796" end="00:37.678" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:34.996" end="00:35.184">I'll</span> <span begin="00:35.184" end="00:35.354">be</span> <span begin="00:35.354" end="00:35.754">gone</span> <span begin="00:35.754" end="00:35.924">with</span> <span begin="00:35.924" end="00:36.087">the</span> <span begin="00:36.087" end="00:36.457">click</span> <span begin="00:36.457" end="00:36.677">of</span> <span begin="00:36.677" end="00:36.810">a</span> <span begin="00:36.810" end="00:37.678">finger</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">弹指之间，我便启程远走</span></p><p begin="00:37.678" end="00:38.609" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:37.856" end="00:38.116">Say</span> <span begin="00:38.116" end="00:38.287">the</span> <span begin="00:38.287" end="00:38.609">word</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只要你开口</span></p><p begin="00:38.609" end="00:39.414" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:38.672" end="00:38.837">Give</span> <span begin="00:38.837" end="00:39.014">a</span> <span begin="00:39.014" end="00:39.414">call</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只要你呼唤</span></p><p begin="00:39.414" end="00:40.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:39.414" end="00:39.576">I'll</span> <span begin="00:39.576" end="00:39.734">be</span> <span begin="00:39.734" end="00:40.109">comin'</span> <span begin="00:40.109" end="00:40.295">back</span> <span begin="00:40.295" end="00:40.910">around</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我定会转身归来</span></p><p begin="00:46.855" end="00:49.607" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:47.055" end="00:47.448">Flying</span> <span begin="00:47.448" end="00:47.578">through</span> <span begin="00:47.578" end="00:47.708">the</span> <span begin="00:47.708" end="00:48.143">city,</span> <span begin="00:48.143" end="00:48.356">I</span> <span begin="00:48.356" end="00:48.505">got</span> <span begin="00:48.505" end="00:48.733">god</span> <span begin="00:48.733" end="00:48.891">on</span> <span begin="00:48.891" end="00:49.151">my</span> <span begin="00:49.151" end="00:49.607">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">穿行城市，似有神明庇护</span></p><p begin="00:49.607" end="00:51.906" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:49.649" end="00:49.818">But</span> <span begin="00:49.818" end="00:49.995">the</span> <span begin="00:49.995" end="00:50.321">real</span> <span begin="00:50.383" end="00:50.546">world</span> <span begin="00:50.546" end="00:50.746">is</span> <span begin="00:50.746" end="00:50.940">not</span> <span begin="00:51.086" end="00:51.906">far</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但现实世界，近在咫尺</span></p><p begin="00:52.671" end="00:55.433" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:52.871" end="00:53.271">Pushed</span> <span begin="00:53.271" end="00:53.471">to